{
  "name": "@crypton/db",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "license": "AGPL-3.0-only",
  "private": true,
  "description": "Esquema Prisma y cliente generado. Fuente unica del modelo de datos para la API y el worker.",
  "main": "dist/src/index.js",
  "types": "dist/src/index.d.ts",
  "comments": {
    "porQuePaquete": "El cliente de Prisma lo necesitan api y worker por igual. Prisma 7 genera TypeScript, no JavaScript, asi que hay que compilarlo: se hace aqui una sola vez y ambas apps consumen el dist. Generarlo dentro de una de las dos obligaria a la otra a importar por ruta relativa, que se rompe al empaquetar en Docker."
  },
  "scripts": {
    "postinstall": "prisma generate && tsc -p tsconfig.json",
    "generate": "prisma generate",
    "studio": "prisma studio",
    "build": "prisma generate && tsc -p tsconfig.json",
    "test": "echo \"sin tests\"",
    "lint": "eslint \"src/**/*.ts\"",
    "lint:fix": "eslint \"src/**/*.ts\" --fix",
    "migrate:dev": "prisma migrate dev",
    "migrate:deploy": "prisma migrate deploy"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "@prisma/adapter-pg": "^7.3.0",
    "@prisma/client": "^7.3.0",
    "pg": "^8.18.0"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@eslint/js": "^9.18.0",
    "@types/node": "^24.0.0",
    "@types/pg": "^8.16.0",
    "dotenv": "^17.2.4",
    "eslint": "^9.18.0",
    "eslint-config-prettier": "^10.0.1",
    "eslint-plugin-prettier": "^5.2.2",
    "globals": "^17.0.0",
    "prettier": "^3.4.2",
    "prisma": "^7.3.0",
    "tsx": "^4.20.0",
    "typescript": "^5.7.3",
    "typescript-eslint": "^8.20.0"
  }
}
